  "full_response_text": "ChartHop is \n\nan organizational intelligence company\n\n that provides a people operations platform. \n\nIt connects your people and business data from any source into a living model of your whole organization, so every decision makes your company stronger\n\n.\n\nThe platform offers several key capabilities:\n\n- **Data Integration**: \n\nThe ChartHop platform connects people and business data, from the systems a company already runs, into a living model of the whole organization: people, work, finance, revenue and operations\n\n. \n\nChartHop works with the technology companies already have, through more than 100 integrations including Workday, ADP, SAP, Greenhouse and Salesforce\n\n.\n\n- **Core Features**: \n\nThe company's platform offers headcount planning, compensation management, performance management, engagement management, and people analytics enabling HR teams, finance teams, and business leaders to plan workforce changes, manage employee data, and analyze organizational performance\n\n.\n\n- **Visual Analytics**: \n\nInstead of having to create pivot tables in Excel, executives can use ChartHop to map out the impact of proposed headcount changes across their whole organization\n\n.\n\n- **AI Assistant**: \n\nAsk ChartHop, ChartHop's AI assistant, is used daily to build dashboards, answer executive questions in the meeting and model org changes\n\n.\n\nThe platform is designed to replace disconnected spreadsheets and manual data management with a unified, automatically-updated view of an organization's workforce and business data.",
